   "Once found, select it by clicking the Radio button. This will auto-fill the 'Mobile Number' field at the bottom.",
   "Click on 'Generate OTP' and then enter the OTP that has been sent to your registered phone number. Click on 'Confirm OTP' once done.",
   "Now you will be able to see the 'Edit CAN Detail' button. Click it and you will be able to update your CAN details."
  ],
  "eligibility": "Users must have a registered phone number and valid login credentials to access the service."
 },
